$ catkin build esvo_time_surface esvo_core
cd catkin_ws
$ source ~/catkin_ws/devel/setup.bash
If you want to view the result of time surface generation, first modify the file path in esvo_time_surface/launch/rosbag_launcher/bobbin/bobbin_omni1.launch and then run
$ roslaunch esvo_time_surface bobbin_time_surface.launch
And open another terminal, run
$ roslaunch esvo_time_surface bobbin_omni1.launch

If you want to run the tracking, open a terminal and run
$ roslaunch esvo_core system_bobbin.launch

